  "notes": {
    "migration": "OpenAI removes these models from the API on 2025-10-10: gpt-4o-audio-preview-2024-10-01. Calls that name them fail after that date. Recommended replacements: gpt-4o-audio-preview-2024-10-01 to gpt-audio-1.5. A newer model can answer differently, so test the switch rather than only renaming.",
